The  driver  provides  support  for  generic memory module Serial
Presence Detect.  During kernel boot it displays module type, and
where possible, the size and rated speed of  the  memory  module.
Additional  information  such  as bank configuration and width is
printed if the kernel is booted  in  verbose  mode.   The  Serial
Presence Detect data for each memory module is also made accessi‐
ble  to  user  mode via An entry for each device is created under
the top‐level MIB.  Some SPD ROMs also have a temperature sensor.
